+  --mode submit \
+  --production-root whitebox_paper_results/e2e_full_system_v3/production
 ```
 
-**Regenerate figures and tables after jobs complete:**
+Refresh aggregate outputs after jobs complete:
+
 ```bash
-cd whitebox_attack/
-conda run -n whitebox python plot_wrong_gap_assessment.py
-conda run -n whitebox python generate_tables.py
+/home/sbhengesa/.conda/envs/whitebox/bin/python -B \
