+## Current Publication Rule
+
+While SLURM jobs from the final matrix are queued or running, do not rename,
+delete, or edit the runtime-imported v3 modules or ODR modules listed above.
+Queued jobs import those files from this working tree when they start.
 
-## Figures
+Safe cleanup during active jobs is limited to documentation, ignored validation
+artifacts, and quarantine moves that do not change final-model run directories.
 
-Publication figures live in [`whitebox_results/figures/`](whitebox_results/figures/). Per-model and 5-model combined figures at 300 DPI covering all conditions (clean, factonly, 5 WGA families).
+## Results Policy
+
+Raw traces, logs, caches, and per-shard runtime files are intentionally ignored
+by git. Publishable outputs are the final matrix, prelaunch report, submission
+records, and aggregate evaluation tables/reports under:
+
+```text
+whitebox_paper_results/e2e_full_system_v3/production/evaluation/final_production/
+```
 
+The aggregate report must be regenerated after the final jobs finish before
+paper numbers are cited.
